{"id":"01a06586-0a54-723e-b87b-526b5902120c","chapterSlug":"rw8-25 KH","paragraph":720,"wording":"[Storm Bandits]","event":"named","holderSlug":"yvlon-byres","holderQuote":"To Yvlon’s surprise, once she’d arrived in the cells, she and the other [Storm Bandits] had been divided up. Their shackles had been removed, and they had been fed, even given fresh clothing, albeit already used. The [Guards] watched them, but didn’t offer to beat them and gave them privacy, even small luxuries."}
